{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01RPd8pisWfyPA6NxVPYQy6E","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted results for each \"planned\" experiment in the experiment_plan, under the \"worst\" tier scenario. I need to provide result_rationale for each prediction explaining why these results would occur under the worst-case assumptions.\n\nLet me go through each planned experiment and predict results under the worst tier:\n\n**Worst tier core assumptions:**\n1. Full data (conf≥1) F1 drops below 0.78, confirming conf≥2 high F1 is selection bias (high conf = easy samples)\n2. Probe on full data shows no significant difference vs LF oracle/Repeat-3, temporal modeling claim doesn't hold\n\n\n3. Cross-agent transfer fails badly with F1 below 0.68, suggesting the generalization claims don't actually hold up\n4. Human annotation reveals majority vote accuracy under 70%, indicating the weak supervision labels aren't reliable enough\n5. Simple mean-pooling with logistic regression performs as well as or better than the GRU, undermining the necessity of temporal modeling\n6. The LF analysis does surface a useful taxonomy of stagnation patterns, which is the one redeeming finding\n\nNow I'm working through the specific experiment predictions starting with probe-002 on full data showing F1 in the 0.68-0.78 range, baseline-lf-oracle barely matching or losing to the LF oracle on full data, and baseline-llm-judge...\n\nLLM judge achieves 0.78-0.88 F1 but at 10-50x computational cost, while mean-pooling with logistic regression stays competitive at 0.66-0.77. The error analysis pinpoints probe failures clustering around semantic stagnation, cross-agent transfer drops to 0.55-0.68, and ablations across window size, architecture, LF holdout, and supervised contrastive learning all show minimal effects. Non-NLP structural features prove surprisingly competitive, data scaling shows no improvement curve, early termination saves marginally, interpretability clusters overlap significantly, and human annotation confirms low accuracy.\n\nThe temporal dynamics of labeling functions reveal some interesting leading and lagging patterns—one of the few genuinely positive findings in this analysis.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10680,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10680},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f5a46152-74b1-408a-bae6-c5406fa64319","uuid":"51755f94-b18c-4554-ac88-cbc163997d9c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01RPd8pisWfyPA6NxVPYQy6E","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始三条claims均无法按设计强度成立。全量数据泛化失败确认conf≥2选择偏差，probe增量价值存疑，\n  跨agent迁移基本失败。Reframe为empirical study：\"What Do Labeling Functions Reveal About\n  Agent Stagnation?\" 核心贡献转向(1)首个大规模agent stagnation弱监督标注框架+taxonomy，\n  LF temporal dynamics分析成为主要发现；(2)全量vs高conf性能差异作为data programming在\n  sequential data上failure mode的实证贡献；(3)负面结果指出未来方向。仍投EMNLP但走Findings track。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"全量数据训练（conf≥1）\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-002\"\n    description: \"全量54,809窗口训练GRU probe，对比conf≥2子集的0.9055基线\"\n    expected_results:\n      fulldata_macro_f1: 0.74\n      fulldata_accuracy: 0.78\n      fulldata_f1_stagnation: 0.67\n      fulldata_f1_progress: 0.81\n      conf2_macro_f1_reference: 0.9055\n      f1_drop_pp: 16.55\n      fulldata_gap_vs_repeat3_pp: 1.2\n      fulldata_val_macro_f1_best: 0.77\n      best_epoch: 5\n    result_rationale: >\n      conf≥1包含39,408个conf=1窗口（占总量72%），这些窗口只有单个LF投票，标签本质上\n      等于单个启发式规则的输出，噪声率极高。在worst档下，这些低置信度标签中相当比例\n      是错误的——尤其是stagnation类，因为command_repetition和file_diff_delta在边界\n      情况下容易误判（例如agent在探索不同文件但diff很小，或重复了一次命令但不构成停滞）。\n      conf≥2的0.9055实际上是选择偏差的产物：高置信度窗口是多个LF一致同意的\"容易\"样本，\n      这些窗口的stagnation模式更明显（反复执行相同命令、diff为零等），分类器在这些\n      pattern-obvious的样本上自然表现好。引入全量数据后，模型需要处理大量歧义样本，\n      GRU无法从嘈杂标签中学到一致的时序信号，F1跌至0.74，与Repeat-3的差距收窄到\n      仅1.2pp，统计上可能不显著（p>0.05），直接动摇Claim 2的核心论据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: conf≥2 vs 全量数据性能对比\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Train Size\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Stag-F1\", \"Prog-F1\", \"Gap vs Repeat-3 (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"conf≥2 (probe-001)\", \"15,401\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"0.9518\", \"+6.24\"]\n          - [\"conf≥1 (full)\", \"54,809\", \"0.74\", \"0.67\", \"0.81\", \"+1.2\"]\n          - [\"Δ\", \"—\", \"-0.1655\", \"-0.1893\", \"-0.1418\", \"-5.04\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: conf≥2 vs conf≥1在macro-F1/stagnation-F1/progress-F1上的对比，附error bar\"\n      - \"Confusion matrix对比：conf≥2训练 vs 全量训练的FP/FN分布差异\"\n    analysis: >\n      F1下降16.55pp证实conf≥2是选择偏差。stagnation-F1下降最严重（-18.93pp），\n      因为低conf窗口中stagnation的歧义性最高。与Repeat-3的差距从6.24pp缩小到1.2pp，\n      在bootstrap CI下不显著。这是核心negative result：probe的\"优势\"高度依赖数据筛选，\n      不具备泛化性。但这本身是data programming在sequential data上的重要failure mode发现。\n\n  - name: \"LF Ensemble Oracle Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-lf-oracle\"\n    description: \"直接用LF实时输出做窗口级判定，不经过任何学习\"\n    expected_results:\n      lf_oracle_conf2_macro_f1: 0.92\n      lf_oracle_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.73\n      lf_oracle_fulldata_stag_f1: 0.66\n      probe_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.74\n      gap_probe_vs_oracle_fulldata_pp: 1.0\n      lf_oracle_coverage: 1.0\n      lf_oracle_conf2_accuracy: 0.94\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF oracle在conf≥2子集上F1达0.92，实际上高于probe的0.9055——因为conf≥2的标签\n      本身就是LF majority vote的输出，oracle直接复现了标签生成过程，probe反而因为\n      学习过程中的泛化损失略低于oracle。这直接证明probe在高conf子集上没有学到超越\n      LF规则的信号，只是在拟合LF的输出。在全量数据上，oracle和probe几乎打平\n      （0.73 vs 0.74，差距1pp），说明probe的时序建模在noisy label下没有提供实质增量。\n      Oracle的优势在于零训练成本、完全可解释、无需embedding——probe的存在变得难以justify。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Probe vs LF Oracle 对比\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"conf≥2 F1\", \"Full-data F1\", \"Training Cost\", \"Interpretability\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LF Oracle (majority vote)\", \"0.92\", \"0.73\", \"None\", \"Full\"]\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"0.9055\", \"0.74\", \"0.5 GPU-hr\", \"Low\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"0.8432\", \"0.728\", \"None\", \"Full\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart: Probe vs LF Oracle vs Repeat-3在conf≥2/全量/stagnation-F1/progress-F1四个维度\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe在全量数据上仅比LF oracle高1pp，与conf≥2上反而低于oracle，证明probe没有\n      超越LF的增量价值。Claim 2（时序建模优于启发式）在全量数据上不成立。但正面发现：\n      LF oracle本身在全量数据上也只有0.73，说明当前LF设计在低conf区域存在系统性盲区，\n      这成为LF taxonomy分析的motivation。\n\n  - name: \"LLM-as-Judge Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-llm-judge\"\n    description: \"Claude/GPT-4o零样本+少样本判定窗口级progress/stagnation\"\n    expected_results:\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_macro_f1: 0.82\n      llm_judge_fewshot_macro_f1: 0.86\n      llm_judge_f1_stagnation: 0.80\n      llm_judge_f1_progress: 0.92\n      llm_judge_latency_ms: 3200\n      probe_latency_ms: 4.5\n      latency_ratio: 711\n      llm_cost_per_1k_windows_usd: 14.50\n      probe_cost_per_1k_windows_usd: 0.08\n      cost_multiplier: 181\n      llm_judge_vs_probe_fulldata_gap_pp: 12.0\n      llm_judge_vs_human_gold_f1: 0.84\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM-as-judge在worst档下表现相对strong（0.86 few-shot），因为LLM本身具备理解\n      agent行为语义的能力，不受弱监督标签噪声的限制。Few-shot F1 0.86显著高于\n      probe全量数据的0.74（+12pp），这进一步削弱probe的价值主张。但LLM的成本和延迟\n      仍然是硬伤：每1k窗口$14.50 vs probe的$0.08，延迟711倍。在worst档的reframe下，\n      这个对比的叙事从\"probe更好\"变成\"probe在cost-constrained场景下是reasonable的\n      trade-off，但如果追求准确率，LLM-as-judge是更优选择\"。cost argument仍然成立\n      但说服力减弱，因为accuracy gap太大（12pp）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLM-as-Judge vs Probe 全量对比\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Stag-F1\", \"Latency (ms)\", \"Cost/1k ($)\", \"Training Required\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GPT-4o zero-shot\", \"0.82\", \"0.76\", \"3200\", \"14.50\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o few-shot (5)\", \"0.86\", \"0.80\", \"4100\", \"18.20\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Claude few-shot (5)\", \"0.84\", \"0.78\", \"2800\", \"12.80\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"GRU Probe (full)\", \"0.74\", \"0.67\", \"4.5\", \"0.08\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"GRU Probe (conf≥2)\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"4.5\", \"0.08\", \"Yes\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cost-Accuracy Pareto\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Annual Cost (50k windows)\", \"Feasible for Real-time\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"0.74\", \"$4\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle\", \"0.73\", \"$0\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"0.728\", \"$0\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"LLM Judge\", \"0.86\", \"$910\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cost-Accuracy Pareto frontier图：x=log(cost per 1k windows)，y=macro-F1，标注各方法\"\n      - \"Latency CDF图：probe vs LLM judge在不同窗口复杂度下的推理时间分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM-as-judge在accuracy上显著优于probe（+12pp），削弱了probe的核心价值。\n      Cost argument仍成立（181倍成本差），但在worst档叙事中需要承认：如果用户关心\n      准确率，LLM是更好选择；probe的唯一优势是成本。Reframe中这变成\"当前轻量probe\n      不足以替代LLM判断，但弱监督框架可以为未来更强的probe提供训练数据\"。\n\n  - name: \"Mean-Pooling + Logistic Regression Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-meanpool-lr\"\n    description: \"窗口内embedding均值池化后接LR，作为非时序对照\"\n    expected_results:\n      meanpool_lr_conf2_macro_f1: 0.87\n      meanpool_lr_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.72\n      meanpool_lr_fulldata_stag_f1: 0.64\n      meanpool_lr_fulldata_prog_f1: 0.80\n      gru_vs_meanpool_conf2_gap_pp: 3.55\n      gru_vs_meanpool_fulldata_gap_pp: 2.0\n      meanpool_lr_training_time_sec: 12\n      gru_training_time_min: 28\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mean-pooling+LR在conf≥2上达0.87，与probe的0.9055差距仅3.55pp；在全量数据上\n      达0.72，与probe的0.74差距仅2pp。这说明GRU的时序建模提供的增量价值很小——\n      大部分分类信号来自embedding本身的语义内容（mean-pool已经捕获了窗口的\"平均语义\"），\n      而非step间的时序动态。在worst档下，这直接证伪了Claim 2的核心前提：stagnation\n      检测不需要时序建模，静态聚合已经足够。LR只需12秒训练（vs GRU 28分钟），\n      参数量级差100倍，性能差距不显著。这支持reframe中\"当前架构不足以超越规则\"的论点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 时序 vs 静态聚合对比\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"conf≥2 F1\", \"Full F1\", \"Params\", \"Train Time\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"0.9055\", \"0.74\", \"~530K\", \"28 min\"]\n          - [\"Mean-pool + LR\", \"0.87\", \"0.72\", \"~1K\", \"12 sec\"]\n          - [\"Gap\", \"+3.55pp\", \"+2.0pp\", \"530x\", \"140x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: GRU vs Mean-pool+LR在两个数据设定下的F1对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      2pp的全量数据差距在bootstrap test下大概率不显著（p~0.08-0.15），直接证伪\n      时序建模的必要性。Mean-pool+LR以1/530的参数量和1/140的训练时间达到几乎相同\n      的性能。在reframe中，这变成\"当前embedding质量下，简单聚合已经接近天花板，\n      暗示瓶颈在标签质量而非模型能力\"。\n\n  - name: \"Probe 错误分析\"\n    plan_id: \"error-analysis\"\n    description: \"FP/FN按action type、LF source、trajectory outcome分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_errors_conf2: 221\n      fp_count: 98\n      fn_count: 123\n      fn_semantic_stagnation_pct: 58\n      fn_late_onset_pct: 24\n      fp_exploration_mislabel_pct: 42\n      fp_conf1_label_noise_pct: 35\n      errors_on_conf1_windows_pct: 71\n      error_rate_conf1: 0.31\n      error_rate_conf2: 0.09\n    result_rationale: >\n      在worst档下，错误分析揭示probe的核心弱点：71%的错误集中在conf=1窗口，\n      error rate在conf=1上高达0.31（vs conf=2的0.09），直接量化了选择偏差的程度。\n      FN中58%是\"语义停滞\"——agent执行不同命令但无实质进展，LF无法捕获这种模式\n      （因为command不重复、diff非零），probe也未能从embedding中学到这一信号。\n      FP中42%是\"探索性行为被误判为停滞\"——agent在尝试不同方案，短期内看似无进展\n      但实际上在收集信息。这些发现本身有价值：它们定义了当前弱监督框架的盲区，\n      为LF taxonomy贡献了\"哪些stagnation模式可以被规则捕获、哪些不能\"的实证证据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 错误分布按confidence分层\"\n        columns: [\"Confidence\", \"Windows\", \"Errors\", \"Error Rate\", \"% of Total Errors\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"conf=1\", \"39,408\", \"12,216\", \"0.31\", \"71%\"]\n          - [\"conf=2\", \"14,609\", \"1,315\", \"0.09\", \"26%\"]\n          - [\"conf=3\", \"792\", \"24\", \"0.03\", \"3%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: FN类型分解\"\n        columns: [\"FN Type\", \"Count\", \"Pct\", \"Example Pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Semantic stagnation\", \"71\", \"58%\", \"Different commands, same ineffective strategy\"]\n          - [\"Late-onset stagnation\", \"30\", \"24%\", \"Progress in first 2 steps, stall in last 3\"]\n          - [\"Ambiguous boundary\", \"22\", \"18%\", \"Partial progress, debatable label\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Sankey diagram: error flow from conf level → error type → action category\"\n      - \"Heatmap: error rate by (trajectory position, LF agreement level)\"\n    analysis: >\n      错误分析的核心发现是conf-stratified error rate的巨大差异（0.31 vs 0.09），\n      这直接量化了选择偏差。语义停滞作为FN主因说明当前embedding+GRU不足以捕获\n      高阶语义等价性。在reframe中，这些发现成为\"failure mode taxonomy\"的实证基础，\n      是贡献(2)的关键数据。\n\n  - name: \"跨Agent迁移评估\"\n    plan_id: \"cross-agent\"\n    description: \"SWE-agent训练的probe在OpenHands轨迹上的zero-shot迁移\"\n    expected_results:\n      openhands_total_trajectories: 1847\n      openhands_total_windows: 28340\n      openhands_lf_adapted_count: 3\n      cross_agent_macro_f1: 0.62\n      cross_agent_stag_f1: 0.53\n      cross_agent_prog_f1: 0.71\n      cross_agent_accuracy: 0.67\n      within_agent_macro_f1_ref: 0.74\n      transfer_drop_pp: 12.0\n      openhands_repeat3_f1: 0.61\n      cross_agent_gap_vs_repeat3_pp: 1.0\n      openhands_lf_coverage: 0.78\n      openhands_conf2_ratio: 0.22\n    result_rationale: >\n      跨agent迁移在worst档下基本失败，F1从0.74（within-agent全量）跌至0.62（-12pp）。\n      根本原因是SWE-agent和OpenHands的行为模式差异大：(1)命令结构不同——OpenHands\n      更多使用Python API调用而非bash命令，command_repetition LF的适配不完全；\n      (2)轨迹长度分布不同——OpenHands轨迹更短，stagnation的表现形式不同（更多是\n      快速失败而非长期停滞）；(3)embedding空间的分布偏移——不同agent产生的step\n      文本风格差异导致embedding不对齐。stagnation-F1仅0.53，说明probe完全无法\n      识别OpenHands特有的停滞模式。更关键的是，probe在OpenHands上仅比Repeat-3\n      高1pp（0.62 vs 0.61），时序建模的迁移性基本为零。Claim 3完全不成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 跨Agent迁移性能\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Stag-F1\", \"Prog-F1\", \"vs Repeat-3\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SWE-agent (conf≥2, in-domain)\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"0.9518\", \"+6.24pp\"]\n          - [\"SWE-agent (full, in-domain)\", \"0.74\", \"0.67\", \"0.81\", \"+1.2pp\"]\n          - [\"OpenHands (zero-shot transfer)\", \"0.62\", \"0.53\", \"0.71\", \"+1.0pp\"]\n          - [\"OpenHands Repeat-3\", \"0.61\", \"0.52\", \"0.70\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table: LF适配覆盖率（OpenHands）\"\n        columns: [\"LF\", \"Adapted\", \"Coverage\", \"Accuracy Est.\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"command_repetition\", \"Yes (regex adapted)\", \"0.82\", \"~0.65\"]\n          - [\"file_diff_delta\", \"Yes (API adapted)\", \"0.71\", \"~0.60\"]\n          - [\"outcome_backprop\", \"Yes (direct)\", \"0.81\", \"~0.70\"]\n          - [\"Overall LF coverage\", \"—\", \"0.78\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Domain shift可视化：SWE-agent vs OpenHands embedding的t-SNE，标注cluster overlap\"\n      - \"Per-trajectory F1分布：SWE-agent in-domain vs OpenHands cross-agent的violin plot\"\n    analysis: >\n      12pp的迁移下降和probe仅比Repeat-3高1pp直接否定Claim 3。但reframe中这成为\n      有价值的negative result：量化了当前弱监督框架的domain-specificity，说明LF\n      适配是跨agent迁移的瓶颈而非embedding/model，指向未来需要agent-agnostic LF\n      设计或meta-learning适配策略。\n\n  - name: \"Window Size 消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-window-size\"\n    description: \"k=3,5,7窗口大小对检测性能的影响\"\n    expected_results:\n      k3_conf2_macro_f1: 0.88\n      k5_conf2_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      k7_conf2_macro_f1: 0.90\n      k3_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.71\n      k5_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.74\n      k7_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.73\n      k5_optimal: true\n      sensitivity_range_pp: 3.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      窗口大小影响有限（全量数据上3pp范围），k=5略优但优势不显著。k=3信号太短，\n      难以积累足够的stagnation证据；k=7引入更多噪声且stagnation边界更模糊。\n      在worst档下，这个消融的意义降低——无论哪个窗口大小，probe都没有显著超越\n      baseline，窗口大小是一个次要超参数而非关键设计决策。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Window Size 消融\"\n        columns: [\"Window k\", \"conf≥2 F1\", \"Full F1\", \"vs Repeat-3 (full)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"k=3\", \"0.88\", \"0.71\", \"-0.18pp\"]\n          - [\"k=5 (default)\", \"0.9055\", \"0.74\", \"+1.2pp\"]\n          - [\"k=7\", \"0.90\", \"0.73\", \"+1.0pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: macro-F1 vs window size k，分conf≥2和全量两条线\"\n    analysis: >\n      窗口大小敏感性低，k=5的选择合理但非关键。在reframe中这成为方法论细节，\n      不作为主要发现。\n\n  - name: \"架构消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-architecture\"\n    description: \"GRU+attention vs GRU+mean-pool vs Transformer vs MLP 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      gru_attn_conf2_f1: 0.9055\n      gru_meanpool_conf2_f1: 0.8950\n      transformer_conf2_f1: 0.8980\n      mlp_pooled_conf2_f1: 0.8820\n      gru_attn_fulldata_f1: 0.74\n      gru_meanpool_fulldata_f1: 0.73\n      transformer_fulldata_f1: 0.74\n      mlp_pooled_fulldata_f1: 0.72\n      architecture_sensitivity_pp: 2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      架构间差异极小（全量数据上2pp范围），在worst档下所有架构都受限于标签质量\n      而非模型容量。GRU+attention名义上最优但优势不显著，Transformer持平，\n      甚至MLP也只差2pp。这证实瓶颈不在模型端——更复杂的架构无法从嘈杂标签中\n      提取更多信号，标签质量是性能天花板。这支持reframe中\"当前embedding+简单架构\n      不足以超越规则\"的论点，同时也说明架构设计不是问题的关键。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 架构消融\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Params\", \"conf≥2 F1\", \"Full F1\", \"Train Time\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU + Attention\", \"~530K\", \"0.9055\", \"0.74\", \"28 min\"]\n          - [\"GRU + Mean-pool\", \"~520K\", \"0.8950\", \"0.73\", \"25 min\"]\n          - [\"Transformer (2L)\", \"~610K\", \"0.8980\", \"0.74\", \"35 min\"]\n          - [\"MLP on pooled\", \"~260K\", \"0.8820\", \"0.72\", \"8 min\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 四种架构在conf≥2和全量数据上的F1对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      架构选择影响微乎其微（≤2pp），确认标签质量是瓶颈。在reframe中这成为\n      负面结果的一部分：\"更强的模型不能弥补弱监督标签的不足\"。\n\n  - name: \"LF Hold-One-Out 消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-lf-holdout\"\n    description: \"每次移除一个LF重新训练，量化各LF边际贡献\"\n    expected_results:\n      without_cmd_rep_conf2_f1: 0.8750\n      without_file_diff_conf2_f1: 0.8830\n      without_outcome_bp_conf2_f1: 0.8920\n      all_lfs_conf2_f1: 0.9055\n      cmd_rep_marginal_pp: 3.05\n      file_diff_marginal_pp: 2.25\n      outcome_bp_marginal_pp: 1.35\n      without_cmd_rep_fulldata_f1: 0.70\n      without_file_diff_fulldata_f1: 0.71\n      without_outcome_bp_fulldata_f1: 0.73\n      all_lfs_fulldata_f1: 0.74\n    result_rationale: >\n      command_repetition是最关键的LF（移除后conf≥2下降3.05pp，全量下降4pp），\n      因为它直接捕获最明显的stagnation信号。但在worst档下，即使最强的LF也只贡献\n      3-4pp，说明LFs之间高度冗余——它们捕获的是同一类\"容易\"的stagnation模式。\n      outcome_backpropagation贡献最小（1.35pp），因为它是lagging indicator，\n      在窗口级别的信号密度低。在全量数据上，移除任何单个LF的影响都不超过4pp，\n      说明LF集合的信息量有限。但正面发现是各LF的边际贡献排序本身揭示了信号层次：\n      command_repetition > file_diff_delta > outcome_backpropagation。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LF Hold-One-Out\"\n        columns: [\"Held-out LF\", \"conf≥2 F1\", \"Δ (pp)\", \"Full F1\", \"Δ (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"None (all LFs)\", \"0.9055\", \"—\", \"0.74\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"– command_repetition\", \"0.8750\", \"-3.05\", \"0.70\", \"-4.0\"]\n          - [\"– file_diff_delta\", \"0.8830\", \"-2.25\", \"0.71\", \"-3.0\"]\n          - [\"– outcome_backprop\", \"0.8920\", \"-1.35\", \"0.73\", \"-1.0\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Waterfall chart: 各LF的边际F1贡献，从baseline逐步叠加\"\n    analysis: >\n      LF贡献排序（cmd_rep > file_diff > outcome_bp）与直觉一致：leading indicator\n      贡献大于lagging indicator。这成为reframe中LF temporal dynamics分析的基础数据，\n      是贡献(1)的核心实证。\n\n  - name: \"SupCon 辅助损失消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-supcon\"\n    description: \"Supervised contrastive loss对F1和embedding分离度的影响\"\n    expected_results:\n      with_supcon_conf2_f1: 0.9055\n      without_supcon_conf2_f1: 0.8980\n      supcon_delta_conf2_pp: 0.75\n      with_supcon_fulldata_f1: 0.74\n      without_supcon_fulldata_f1: 0.73\n      supcon_delta_fulldata_pp: 1.0\n      embedding_separation_with: 0.42\n      embedding_separation_without: 0.38\n    result_rationale: >\n      SupCon在conf≥2上仅贡献0.75pp，在全量数据上1pp，在worst档下统计不显著。\n      原因是当标签本身噪声大时，contrastive loss试图拉近同标签样本、推远异标签\n      样本，但标签错误导致它在推错误的方向上也施加了力——净效果接近零。\n      Embedding分离度从0.38提升到0.42，改善有限。这确认在低标签质量下，\n      辅助损失的价值有限。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: SupCon 消融\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"conf≥2 F1\", \"Full F1\", \"Embed Separation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"With SupCon\", \"0.9055\", \"0.74\", \"0.42\"]\n          - [\"Without SupCon\", \"0.8980\", \"0.73\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"Δ\", \"+0.75pp\", \"+1.0pp\", \"+0.04\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE: with vs without SupCon的embedding空间对比，按label着色\"\n    analysis: >\n      SupCon增量不显著，确认标签噪声限制了contrastive learning的有效性。\n      在worst档下这是预期结果，不作为主要发现。\n\n  - name: \"Non-NLP Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"non-nlp-baseline\"\n    description: \"纯结构特征（行数改动、AST diff、test counts）分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      non_nlp_conf2_macro_f1: 0.83\n      non_nlp_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.70\n      non_nlp_stag_f1: 0.63\n      nlp_probe_fulldata_f1: 0.74\n      gap_nlp_vs_non_nlp_pp: 4.0\n      non_nlp_feature_count: 12\n      non_nlp_training_time_sec: 5\n    result_rationale: >\n      非NLP baseline在conf≥2上达0.83，全量数据0.70，与probe的差距仅4pp。\n      在worst档下，这个差距虽然存在但不够convincing——纯结构特征已经捕获了\n      stagnation的大部分信号（file改动数=0、命令失败率高、test pass率不变等）。\n      NL embedding的增量价值仅4pp，且这4pp可能来自embedding中隐含的结构信息\n      而非真正的语义理解。这削弱了venue fit argument（\"NL embedding是必要的\"），\n      但不完全否定——4pp在某些边界情况下可能是有意义的差异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: NLP vs Non-NLP Features\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Features\", \"conf≥2 F1\", \"Full F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe (NLP)\", \"1024-d embeddings\", \"0.9055\", \"0.74\"]\n          - [\"GBM (Non-NLP)\", \"12 structural features\", \"0.83\", \"0.70\"]\n          - [\"Gap\", \"—\", \"+7.55pp\", \"+4.0pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Feature importance plot: non-NLP baseline的top-12结构特征重要性排序\"\n    analysis: >\n      Non-NLP baseline竞争力较强，NL embedding增量有限。在reframe中需要弱化\n      \"NL embedding必要性\"的claim，转向\"embedding提供互补信号但非压倒性优势\"。\n\n  - name: \"Data Scaling 曲线\"\n    plan_id: \"data-scaling\"\n    description: \"10%/25%/50%/100%训练数据 → probe F1\"\n    expected_results:\n      scale_10pct_f1: 0.69\n      scale_25pct_f1: 0.72\n      scale_50pct_f1: 0.73\n      scale_100pct_f1: 0.74\n      curve_shape: \"log-saturating\"\n      saturation_point_pct: 30\n      marginal_gain_50_to_100_pp: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Scaling曲线在~30%数据量后即饱和，50%→100%仅增1pp。在worst档下这说明两件事：\n      (1)模型容量不是瓶颈——更多数据不能显著提升性能，因为新增数据主要是低conf噪声样本；\n      (2)当前架构+标签质量的性能天花板约在0.74-0.75。这是一个清醒的发现：\n      简单地收集更多弱监督数据不是解决方案，需要根本性地改善标签质量或模型能力。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Data Scaling\"\n        columns: [\"Train %\", \"Windows\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Δ vs previous\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"10%\", \"~4,380\", \"0.69\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"25%\", \"~10,960\", \"0.72\", \"+3pp\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"~21,920\", \"0.73\", \"+1pp\"]\n          - [\"100%\", \"43,847\", \"0.74\", \"+1pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Log-scale learning curve: x=训练数据量(log), y=macro-F1, 附95% CI band\"\n    analysis: >\n      早期饱和确认标签质量（而非数据量）是瓶颈。在reframe中这成为\"data programming\n      在sequential data上的scaling limitation\"的实证。\n\n  - name: \"Simulated Early Termination\"\n    plan_id: \"early-termination-sim\"\n    description: \"在held-out轨迹上模拟基于probe的early stopping，计算token节省vs成功率\"\n    expected_results:\n      tokens_saved_pct_probe: 18\n      tokens_saved_pct_repeat3: 16\n      tokens_saved_pct_oracle: 22\n      success_rate_drop_probe_pp: 4.5\n      success_rate_drop_repeat3_pp: 3.8\n      success_rate_drop_oracle_pp: 2.1\n      intervention_paradox_rate: 0.35\n      net_value_probe_vs_repeat3: \"marginal\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在worst档下，probe全量数据F1仅0.74，导致early termination的precision不足：\n      probe触发的停止中约26%是false positive（实际有进展但被判为停滞），导致\n      成功率下降4.5pp换取仅18%的token节省。更关键的是，Repeat-3作为简单规则也能\n      节省16%的token（仅少2pp），成功率下降还更小（3.8pp），说明probe的early\n      termination价值相对于简单规则几乎为零。Intervention paradox率0.35意味着\n      35%的被中止轨迹\"如果继续可能会成功\"，这进一步削弱了实用价值的论证。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Early Termination Simulation\"\n        columns: [\"Detector\", \"Tokens Saved (%)\", \"Success Rate Drop (pp)\", \"Efficiency Ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe (full)\", \"18%\", \"-4.5\", \"4.0\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"16%\", \"-3.8\", \"4.2\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle\", \"22%\", \"-2.1\", \"10.5\"]\n          - [\"LLM Judge\", \"25%\", \"-1.5\", \"16.7\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto curve: tokens saved (%) vs success rate drop (pp)，标注各方法\"\n      - \"Intervention paradox分析: 被中止轨迹中'如果继续会成功'的比例\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe的early termination价值marginally优于Repeat-3（多省2%token但多损1pp成功率），\n      净效果不具说服力。LLM judge反而是最优的早停检测器。在reframe中early termination\n      不再作为核心应用场景，仅在discussion中简短提及。\n\n  - name: \"Interpretability 可视化\"\n    plan_id: \"interpretability\"\n    description: \"GRU hidden states的t-SNE/UMAP + attention weight分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      cluster_separation_silhouette: 0.28\n      progress_stuck_overlap_pct: 35\n      attention_onset_concentration: 0.45\n      attention_pattern_interpretable: \"partial\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在worst档下，GRU hidden states的progress/stagnation聚类分离度较低\n      （silhouette=0.28，理想值>0.5），35%的样本在t-SNE空间上重叠。这反映了\n      两个问题：(1)标签噪声导致同一语义区域内混杂了两种标签；(2)GRU未能学到\n      清晰区分两类的表示。Attention weights在stagnation onset位置有一定集中\n      （concentration=0.45），但不够sharp来讲一个清晰的\"模型关注stagnation起始点\"\n      的故事。整体可解释性分析结果是\"partial\"——有一些可视化上看起来合理的pattern，\n      但不够compelling来支撑一个独立的发现。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 表示空间质量指标\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\", \"Ideal\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Silhouette score\", \"0.28\", \">0.5\"]\n          - [\"Class overlap %\", \"35%\", \"<15%\"]\n          - [\"Attention onset concentration\", \"0.45\", \">0.7\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE/UMAP: GRU final hidden states, colored by label, with conf-level as marker size\"\n      - \"Attention heatmap: 5个stagnation onset案例的attention weight分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      可视化结果不够compelling支撑独立发现。在reframe中降级为appendix材料，\n      不在正文中作为主要贡献。高overlap区域（conf=1样本主导）反而可以可视化\n      选择偏差——作为failure mode分析的补充。\n\n  - name: \"人工标注 Gold Set\"\n    plan_id: \"human-annotation\"\n    description: \"400窗口3标注者人工标注，Fleiss κ，在gold标签上重新评估所有方法\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_annotated: 400\n      fleiss_kappa: 0.52\n      human_majority_accuracy_vs_lf: 0.67\n      human_gold_probe_conf2_f1: 0.78\n      human_gold_probe_fulldata_f1: 0.68\n      human_gold_repeat3_f1: 0.72\n      human_gold_lf_oracle_f1: 0.65\n      human_gold_llm_judge_f1: 0.84\n      human_gold_meanpool_lr_f1: 0.66\n      disagreement_rate_3way: 0.28\n      semantic_stagnation_kappa: 0.38\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fleiss κ=0.52（moderate agreement）揭示stagnation本身是一个高主观性的概念——\n      标注者对\"语义停滞\"的判断分歧大（子类κ仅0.38）。LF majority vote与人工标签\n      的一致率仅67%，低于Phase 1 paper_framing.md声称的81.5%（那个数字仅在conf≥2\n      子集上测量）。在人工gold标签上重新评估：probe conf≥2的F1从0.9055跌至0.78，\n      probe全量从0.74跌至0.68——大幅下降是因为probe优化的目标（LF标签）与真实标签\n      存在系统性偏差。更关键的是，probe全量的0.68与Repeat-3的0.72相比反而落后4pp，\n      意味着在真实标签上probe不如简单启发式。LLM judge在gold标签上达0.84，是所有方法\n      中最好的——但成本高。这组结果是worst档的核心证据：弱监督标签质量不足，\n      probe在真实标签上无法beat baseline。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Human Gold Set 评估\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Gold-F1\", \"LF-label F1\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe (conf≥2)\", \"0.78\", \"0.9055\", \"-12.55pp\"]\n          - [\"GRU Probe (full)\", \"0.68\", \"0.74\", \"-6.0pp\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"0.72\", \"0.8432\", \"-12.32pp\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle\", \"0.65\", \"0.92\", \"-27.0pp\"]\n          - [\"Mean-pool + LR\", \"0.66\", \"0.72\", \"-6.0pp\"]\n          - [\"LLM Judge (few-shot)\", \"0.84\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table: 标注者一致性\"\n        columns: [\"Category\", \"Fleiss κ\", \"Agreement %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Overall\", \"0.52\", \"72%\"]\n          - [\"Clear progress\", \"0.68\", \"84%\"]\n          - [\"Clear stagnation\", \"0.61\", \"78%\"]\n          - [\"Semantic stagnation\", \"0.38\", \"58%\"]\n          - [\"Ambiguous\", \"0.29\", \"45%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix: LF majority vote vs human gold labels, 按conf分层\"\n      - \"方法对比bar chart: 所有方法在gold标签上的macro-F1，附CI\"\n      - \"Inter-annotator disagreement heatmap: 按stagnation子类型的κ值\"\n    analysis: >\n      人工标注是worst档的决定性证据。LF标签准确率67%（远低于声称的81.5%）直接\n      否定Claim 1。Probe在gold标签上落后Repeat-3（0.68 vs 0.72）否定Claim 2。\n      但κ=0.52也揭示了任务本身的固有困难——stagnation不是二元的，未来需要更细粒度\n      的标注schema（如进展程度的连续评分）。这在reframe中成为方法论贡献：\n      \"首次量化了agent stagnation标注的人类一致性上界\"。\n\n  - name: \"LF Temporal Dynamics\"\n    plan_id: \"lf-temporal-dynamics\"\n    description: \"分析各LF在stagnation onset相对时间上的激活模式\"\n    expected_results:\n      cmd_rep_avg_lead_steps: 1.8\n      cmd_rep_leading_indicator: true\n      file_diff_avg_lead_steps: 0.5\n      file_diff_concurrent: true\n      outcome_bp_avg_lag_steps: 2.3\n      outcome_bp_lagging_indicator: true\n      temporal_ordering_consistent_pct: 72\n      lf_transition_patterns_found: 4\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF temporal dynamics是worst档下最有价值的正面发现。command_repetition\n      平均在stagnation onset前1.8步开始亮灯（leading indicator）——agent开始\n      重复命令是停滞的早期信号。file_diff_delta几乎同时激活（concurrent，lead 0.5步），\n      因为命令重复很快导致文件变化停滞。outcome_backpropagation滞后2.3步\n      （lagging indicator），因为最终结果（test failure）需要等到窗口末端才能观察到。\n      这个leading→concurrent→lagging的时序排列在72%的stagnation事件中一致，\n      构成一个可复现的\"stagnation onset signature\"。此外发现4种distinct的LF\n      transition patterns（如\"cmd_rep先亮→file_diff跟随\"vs\"file_diff先亮→cmd_rep不亮\"），\n      揭示了不同类型的stagnation有不同的信号组合。这是reframe后论文的核心发现之一，\n      因为它不依赖probe性能，而是对stagnation现象本身的实证分析。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LF Temporal Ordering\"\n        columns: [\"LF\", \"Avg Lead/Lag (steps)\", \"Role\", \"Activation Rate at Onset\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"command_repetition\", \"-1.8 (lead)\", \"Leading\", \"0.78\"]\n          - [\"file_diff_delta\", \"-0.5 (concurrent)\", \"Concurrent\", \"0.71\"]\n          - [\"outcome_backprop\", \"+2.3 (lag)\", \"Lagging\", \"0.64\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Stagnation Onset Transition Patterns\"\n        columns: [\"Pattern\", \"Frequency\", \"Description\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Type A: cmd→file→outcome\", \"42%\", \"Classic repetition-driven stagnation\"]\n          - [\"Type B: file→cmd→outcome\", \"18%\", \"Exploration failure (new files, same errors)\"]\n          - [\"Type C: cmd only\", \"15%\", \"Pure command loop, files never change\"]\n          - [\"Type D: outcome→file→cmd\", \"12%\", \"Cascading failure from bad early decision\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Timeline visualization: 5个case study的LF激活时序，显示leading/lagging关系\"\n      - \"Heatmap: LF co-activation patterns across stagnation onset ±5 steps\"\n      - \"Stagnation taxonomy pie chart: 4种transition pattern的分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      LF temporal dynamics是worst档reframe的核心贡献。4种stagnation onset pattern\n      构成首个基于实证的agent stagnation taxonomy。Leading/lagging排序提供了\n      实际的工程价值——在部署场景下可以仅监控command_repetition作为早期预警，\n      无需等待所有LF激活。这个发现不依赖probe性能，因此在worst档下仍然成立，\n      成为论文从\"method paper\"转向\"empirical study\"的关键支撑。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10680,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10680},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f5a46152-74b1-408a-bae6-c5406fa64319","uuid":"bbee43f3-0e1e-4de4-b797-91ec0b72be05"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":272613,"duration_api_ms":274044,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始三条claims均无法按设计强度成立。全量数据泛化失败确认conf≥2选择偏差，probe增量价值存疑，\n  跨agent迁移基本失败。Reframe为empirical study：\"What Do Labeling Functions Reveal About\n  Agent Stagnation?\" 核心贡献转向(1)首个大规模agent stagnation弱监督标注框架+taxonomy，\n  LF temporal dynamics分析成为主要发现；(2)全量vs高conf性能差异作为data programming在\n  sequential data上failure mode的实证贡献；(3)负面结果指出未来方向。仍投EMNLP但走Findings track。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"全量数据训练（conf≥1）\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-002\"\n    description: \"全量54,809窗口训练GRU probe，对比conf≥2子集的0.9055基线\"\n    expected_results:\n      fulldata_macro_f1: 0.74\n      fulldata_accuracy: 0.78\n      fulldata_f1_stagnation: 0.67\n      fulldata_f1_progress: 0.81\n      conf2_macro_f1_reference: 0.9055\n      f1_drop_pp: 16.55\n      fulldata_gap_vs_repeat3_pp: 1.2\n      fulldata_val_macro_f1_best: 0.77\n      best_epoch: 5\n    result_rationale: >\n      conf≥1包含39,408个conf=1窗口（占总量72%），这些窗口只有单个LF投票，标签本质上\n      等于单个启发式规则的输出，噪声率极高。在worst档下，这些低置信度标签中相当比例\n      是错误的——尤其是stagnation类，因为command_repetition和file_diff_delta在边界\n      情况下容易误判（例如agent在探索不同文件但diff很小，或重复了一次命令但不构成停滞）。\n      conf≥2的0.9055实际上是选择偏差的产物：高置信度窗口是多个LF一致同意的\"容易\"样本，\n      这些窗口的stagnation模式更明显（反复执行相同命令、diff为零等），分类器在这些\n      pattern-obvious的样本上自然表现好。引入全量数据后，模型需要处理大量歧义样本，\n      GRU无法从嘈杂标签中学到一致的时序信号，F1跌至0.74，与Repeat-3的差距收窄到\n      仅1.2pp，统计上可能不显著（p>0.05），直接动摇Claim 2的核心论据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: conf≥2 vs 全量数据性能对比\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Train Size\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Stag-F1\", \"Prog-F1\", \"Gap vs Repeat-3 (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"conf≥2 (probe-001)\", \"15,401\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"0.9518\", \"+6.24\"]\n          - [\"conf≥1 (full)\", \"54,809\", \"0.74\", \"0.67\", \"0.81\", \"+1.2\"]\n          - [\"Δ\", \"—\", \"-0.1655\", \"-0.1893\", \"-0.1418\", \"-5.04\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: conf≥2 vs conf≥1在macro-F1/stagnation-F1/progress-F1上的对比，附error bar\"\n      - \"Confusion matrix对比：conf≥2训练 vs 全量训练的FP/FN分布差异\"\n    analysis: >\n      F1下降16.55pp证实conf≥2是选择偏差。stagnation-F1下降最严重（-18.93pp），\n      因为低conf窗口中stagnation的歧义性最高。与Repeat-3的差距从6.24pp缩小到1.2pp，\n      在bootstrap CI下不显著。这是核心negative result：probe的\"优势\"高度依赖数据筛选，\n      不具备泛化性。但这本身是data programming在sequential data上的重要failure mode发现。\n\n  - name: \"LF Ensemble Oracle Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-lf-oracle\"\n    description: \"直接用LF实时输出做窗口级判定，不经过任何学习\"\n    expected_results:\n      lf_oracle_conf2_macro_f1: 0.92\n      lf_oracle_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.73\n      lf_oracle_fulldata_stag_f1: 0.66\n      probe_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.74\n      gap_probe_vs_oracle_fulldata_pp: 1.0\n      lf_oracle_coverage: 1.0\n      lf_oracle_conf2_accuracy: 0.94\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF oracle在conf≥2子集上F1达0.92，实际上高于probe的0.9055——因为conf≥2的标签\n      本身就是LF majority vote的输出，oracle直接复现了标签生成过程，probe反而因为\n      学习过程中的泛化损失略低于oracle。这直接证明probe在高conf子集上没有学到超越\n      LF规则的信号，只是在拟合LF的输出。在全量数据上，oracle和probe几乎打平\n      （0.73 vs 0.74，差距1pp），说明probe的时序建模在noisy label下没有提供实质增量。\n      Oracle的优势在于零训练成本、完全可解释、无需embedding——probe的存在变得难以justify。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Probe vs LF Oracle 对比\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"conf≥2 F1\", \"Full-data F1\", \"Training Cost\", \"Interpretability\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LF Oracle (majority vote)\", \"0.92\", \"0.73\", \"None\", \"Full\"]\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"0.9055\", \"0.74\", \"0.5 GPU-hr\", \"Low\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"0.8432\", \"0.728\", \"None\", \"Full\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart: Probe vs LF Oracle vs Repeat-3在conf≥2/全量/stagnation-F1/progress-F1四个维度\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe在全量数据上仅比LF oracle高1pp，与conf≥2上反而低于oracle，证明probe没有\n      超越LF的增量价值。Claim 2（时序建模优于启发式）在全量数据上不成立。但正面发现：\n      LF oracle本身在全量数据上也只有0.73，说明当前LF设计在低conf区域存在系统性盲区，\n      这成为LF taxonomy分析的motivation。\n\n  - name: \"LLM-as-Judge Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-llm-judge\"\n    description: \"Claude/GPT-4o零样本+少样本判定窗口级progress/stagnation\"\n    expected_results:\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_macro_f1: 0.82\n      llm_judge_fewshot_macro_f1: 0.86\n      llm_judge_f1_stagnation: 0.80\n      llm_judge_f1_progress: 0.92\n      llm_judge_latency_ms: 3200\n      probe_latency_ms: 4.5\n      latency_ratio: 711\n      llm_cost_per_1k_windows_usd: 14.50\n      probe_cost_per_1k_windows_usd: 0.08\n      cost_multiplier: 181\n      llm_judge_vs_probe_fulldata_gap_pp: 12.0\n      llm_judge_vs_human_gold_f1: 0.84\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM-as-judge在worst档下表现相对strong（0.86 few-shot），因为LLM本身具备理解\n      agent行为语义的能力，不受弱监督标签噪声的限制。Few-shot F1 0.86显著高于\n      probe全量数据的0.74（+12pp），这进一步削弱probe的价值主张。但LLM的成本和延迟\n      仍然是硬伤：每1k窗口$14.50 vs probe的$0.08，延迟711倍。在worst档的reframe下，\n      这个对比的叙事从\"probe更好\"变成\"probe在cost-constrained场景下是reasonable的\n      trade-off，但如果追求准确率，LLM-as-judge是更优选择\"。cost argument仍然成立\n      但说服力减弱，因为accuracy gap太大（12pp）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLM-as-Judge vs Probe 全量对比\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Stag-F1\", \"Latency (ms)\", \"Cost/1k ($)\", \"Training Required\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GPT-4o zero-shot\", \"0.82\", \"0.76\", \"3200\", \"14.50\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o few-shot (5)\", \"0.86\", \"0.80\", \"4100\", \"18.20\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Claude few-shot (5)\", \"0.84\", \"0.78\", \"2800\", \"12.80\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"GRU Probe (full)\", \"0.74\", \"0.67\", \"4.5\", \"0.08\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"GRU Probe (conf≥2)\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"4.5\", \"0.08\", \"Yes\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cost-Accuracy Pareto\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Annual Cost (50k windows)\", \"Feasible for Real-time\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"0.74\", \"$4\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle\", \"0.73\", \"$0\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"0.728\", \"$0\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"LLM Judge\", \"0.86\", \"$910\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cost-Accuracy Pareto frontier图：x=log(cost per 1k windows)，y=macro-F1，标注各方法\"\n      - \"Latency CDF图：probe vs LLM judge在不同窗口复杂度下的推理时间分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM-as-judge在accuracy上显著优于probe（+12pp），削弱了probe的核心价值。\n      Cost argument仍成立（181倍成本差），但在worst档叙事中需要承认：如果用户关心\n      准确率，LLM是更好选择；probe的唯一优势是成本。Reframe中这变成\"当前轻量probe\n      不足以替代LLM判断，但弱监督框架可以为未来更强的probe提供训练数据\"。\n\n  - name: \"Mean-Pooling + Logistic Regression Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-meanpool-lr\"\n    description: \"窗口内embedding均值池化后接LR，作为非时序对照\"\n    expected_results:\n      meanpool_lr_conf2_macro_f1: 0.87\n      meanpool_lr_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.72\n      meanpool_lr_fulldata_stag_f1: 0.64\n      meanpool_lr_fulldata_prog_f1: 0.80\n      gru_vs_meanpool_conf2_gap_pp: 3.55\n      gru_vs_meanpool_fulldata_gap_pp: 2.0\n      meanpool_lr_training_time_sec: 12\n      gru_training_time_min: 28\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mean-pooling+LR在conf≥2上达0.87，与probe的0.9055差距仅3.55pp；在全量数据上\n      达0.72，与probe的0.74差距仅2pp。这说明GRU的时序建模提供的增量价值很小——\n      大部分分类信号来自embedding本身的语义内容（mean-pool已经捕获了窗口的\"平均语义\"），\n      而非step间的时序动态。在worst档下，这直接证伪了Claim 2的核心前提：stagnation\n      检测不需要时序建模，静态聚合已经足够。LR只需12秒训练（vs GRU 28分钟），\n      参数量级差100倍，性能差距不显著。这支持reframe中\"当前架构不足以超越规则\"的论点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 时序 vs 静态聚合对比\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"conf≥2 F1\", \"Full F1\", \"Params\", \"Train Time\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"0.9055\", \"0.74\", \"~530K\", \"28 min\"]\n          - [\"Mean-pool + LR\", \"0.87\", \"0.72\", \"~1K\", \"12 sec\"]\n          - [\"Gap\", \"+3.55pp\", \"+2.0pp\", \"530x\", \"140x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: GRU vs Mean-pool+LR在两个数据设定下的F1对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      2pp的全量数据差距在bootstrap test下大概率不显著（p~0.08-0.15），直接证伪\n      时序建模的必要性。Mean-pool+LR以1/530的参数量和1/140的训练时间达到几乎相同\n      的性能。在reframe中，这变成\"当前embedding质量下，简单聚合已经接近天花板，\n      暗示瓶颈在标签质量而非模型能力\"。\n\n  - name: \"Probe 错误分析\"\n    plan_id: \"error-analysis\"\n    description: \"FP/FN按action type、LF source、trajectory outcome分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_errors_conf2: 221\n      fp_count: 98\n      fn_count: 123\n      fn_semantic_stagnation_pct: 58\n      fn_late_onset_pct: 24\n      fp_exploration_mislabel_pct: 42\n      fp_conf1_label_noise_pct: 35\n      errors_on_conf1_windows_pct: 71\n      error_rate_conf1: 0.31\n      error_rate_conf2: 0.09\n    result_rationale: >\n      在worst档下，错误分析揭示probe的核心弱点：71%的错误集中在conf=1窗口，\n      error rate在conf=1上高达0.31（vs conf=2的0.09），直接量化了选择偏差的程度。\n      FN中58%是\"语义停滞\"——agent执行不同命令但无实质进展，LF无法捕获这种模式\n      （因为command不重复、diff非零），probe也未能从embedding中学到这一信号。\n      FP中42%是\"探索性行为被误判为停滞\"——agent在尝试不同方案，短期内看似无进展\n      但实际上在收集信息。这些发现本身有价值：它们定义了当前弱监督框架的盲区，\n      为LF taxonomy贡献了\"哪些stagnation模式可以被规则捕获、哪些不能\"的实证证据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 错误分布按confidence分层\"\n        columns: [\"Confidence\", \"Windows\", \"Errors\", \"Error Rate\", \"% of Total Errors\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"conf=1\", \"39,408\", \"12,216\", \"0.31\", \"71%\"]\n          - [\"conf=2\", \"14,609\", \"1,315\", \"0.09\", \"26%\"]\n          - [\"conf=3\", \"792\", \"24\", \"0.03\", \"3%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: FN类型分解\"\n        columns: [\"FN Type\", \"Count\", \"Pct\", \"Example Pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Semantic stagnation\", \"71\", \"58%\", \"Different commands, same ineffective strategy\"]\n          - [\"Late-onset stagnation\", \"30\", \"24%\", \"Progress in first 2 steps, stall in last 3\"]\n          - [\"Ambiguous boundary\", \"22\", \"18%\", \"Partial progress, debatable label\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Sankey diagram: error flow from conf level → error type → action category\"\n      - \"Heatmap: error rate by (trajectory position, LF agreement level)\"\n    analysis: >\n      错误分析的核心发现是conf-stratified error rate的巨大差异（0.31 vs 0.09），\n      这直接量化了选择偏差。语义停滞作为FN主因说明当前embedding+GRU不足以捕获\n      高阶语义等价性。在reframe中，这些发现成为\"failure mode taxonomy\"的实证基础，\n      是贡献(2)的关键数据。\n\n  - name: \"跨Agent迁移评估\"\n    plan_id: \"cross-agent\"\n    description: \"SWE-agent训练的probe在OpenHands轨迹上的zero-shot迁移\"\n    expected_results:\n      openhands_total_trajectories: 1847\n      openhands_total_windows: 28340\n      openhands_lf_adapted_count: 3\n      cross_agent_macro_f1: 0.62\n      cross_agent_stag_f1: 0.53\n      cross_agent_prog_f1: 0.71\n      cross_agent_accuracy: 0.67\n      within_agent_macro_f1_ref: 0.74\n      transfer_drop_pp: 12.0\n      openhands_repeat3_f1: 0.61\n      cross_agent_gap_vs_repeat3_pp: 1.0\n      openhands_lf_coverage: 0.78\n      openhands_conf2_ratio: 0.22\n    result_rationale: >\n      跨agent迁移在worst档下基本失败，F1从0.74（within-agent全量）跌至0.62（-12pp）。\n      根本原因是SWE-agent和OpenHands的行为模式差异大：(1)命令结构不同——OpenHands\n      更多使用Python API调用而非bash命令，command_repetition LF的适配不完全；\n      (2)轨迹长度分布不同——OpenHands轨迹更短，stagnation的表现形式不同（更多是\n      快速失败而非长期停滞）；(3)embedding空间的分布偏移——不同agent产生的step\n      文本风格差异导致embedding不对齐。stagnation-F1仅0.53，说明probe完全无法\n      识别OpenHands特有的停滞模式。更关键的是，probe在OpenHands上仅比Repeat-3\n      高1pp（0.62 vs 0.61），时序建模的迁移性基本为零。Claim 3完全不成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 跨Agent迁移性能\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Stag-F1\", \"Prog-F1\", \"vs Repeat-3\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SWE-agent (conf≥2, in-domain)\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"0.9518\", \"+6.24pp\"]\n          - [\"SWE-agent (full, in-domain)\", \"0.74\", \"0.67\", \"0.81\", \"+1.2pp\"]\n          - [\"OpenHands (zero-shot transfer)\", \"0.62\", \"0.53\", \"0.71\", \"+1.0pp\"]\n          - [\"OpenHands Repeat-3\", \"0.61\", \"0.52\", \"0.70\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table: LF适配覆盖率（OpenHands）\"\n        columns: [\"LF\", \"Adapted\", \"Coverage\", \"Accuracy Est.\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"command_repetition\", \"Yes (regex adapted)\", \"0.82\", \"~0.65\"]\n          - [\"file_diff_delta\", \"Yes (API adapted)\", \"0.71\", \"~0.60\"]\n          - [\"outcome_backprop\", \"Yes (direct)\", \"0.81\", \"~0.70\"]\n          - [\"Overall LF coverage\", \"—\", \"0.78\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Domain shift可视化：SWE-agent vs OpenHands embedding的t-SNE，标注cluster overlap\"\n      - \"Per-trajectory F1分布：SWE-agent in-domain vs OpenHands cross-agent的violin plot\"\n    analysis: >\n      12pp的迁移下降和probe仅比Repeat-3高1pp直接否定Claim 3。但reframe中这成为\n      有价值的negative result：量化了当前弱监督框架的domain-specificity，说明LF\n      适配是跨agent迁移的瓶颈而非embedding/model，指向未来需要agent-agnostic LF\n      设计或meta-learning适配策略。\n\n  - name: \"Window Size 消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-window-size\"\n    description: \"k=3,5,7窗口大小对检测性能的影响\"\n    expected_results:\n      k3_conf2_macro_f1: 0.88\n      k5_conf2_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      k7_conf2_macro_f1: 0.90\n      k3_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.71\n      k5_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.74\n      k7_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.73\n      k5_optimal: true\n      sensitivity_range_pp: 3.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      窗口大小影响有限（全量数据上3pp范围），k=5略优但优势不显著。k=3信号太短，\n      难以积累足够的stagnation证据；k=7引入更多噪声且stagnation边界更模糊。\n      在worst档下，这个消融的意义降低——无论哪个窗口大小，probe都没有显著超越\n      baseline，窗口大小是一个次要超参数而非关键设计决策。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Window Size 消融\"\n        columns: [\"Window k\", \"conf≥2 F1\", \"Full F1\", \"vs Repeat-3 (full)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"k=3\", \"0.88\", \"0.71\", \"-0.18pp\"]\n          - [\"k=5 (default)\", \"0.9055\", \"0.74\", \"+1.2pp\"]\n          - [\"k=7\", \"0.90\", \"0.73\", \"+1.0pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: macro-F1 vs window size k，分conf≥2和全量两条线\"\n    analysis: >\n      窗口大小敏感性低，k=5的选择合理但非关键。在reframe中这成为方法论细节，\n      不作为主要发现。\n\n  - name: \"架构消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-architecture\"\n    description: \"GRU+attention vs GRU+mean-pool vs Transformer vs MLP 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      gru_attn_conf2_f1: 0.9055\n      gru_meanpool_conf2_f1: 0.8950\n      transformer_conf2_f1: 0.8980\n      mlp_pooled_conf2_f1: 0.8820\n      gru_attn_fulldata_f1: 0.74\n      gru_meanpool_fulldata_f1: 0.73\n      transformer_fulldata_f1: 0.74\n      mlp_pooled_fulldata_f1: 0.72\n      architecture_sensitivity_pp: 2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      架构间差异极小（全量数据上2pp范围），在worst档下所有架构都受限于标签质量\n      而非模型容量。GRU+attention名义上最优但优势不显著，Transformer持平，\n      甚至MLP也只差2pp。这证实瓶颈不在模型端——更复杂的架构无法从嘈杂标签中\n      提取更多信号，标签质量是性能天花板。这支持reframe中\"当前embedding+简单架构\n      不足以超越规则\"的论点，同时也说明架构设计不是问题的关键。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 架构消融\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Params\", \"conf≥2 F1\", \"Full F1\", \"Train Time\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU + Attention\", \"~530K\", \"0.9055\", \"0.74\", \"28 min\"]\n          - [\"GRU + Mean-pool\", \"~520K\", \"0.8950\", \"0.73\", \"25 min\"]\n          - [\"Transformer (2L)\", \"~610K\", \"0.8980\", \"0.74\", \"35 min\"]\n          - [\"MLP on pooled\", \"~260K\", \"0.8820\", \"0.72\", \"8 min\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 四种架构在conf≥2和全量数据上的F1对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      架构选择影响微乎其微（≤2pp），确认标签质量是瓶颈。在reframe中这成为\n      负面结果的一部分：\"更强的模型不能弥补弱监督标签的不足\"。\n\n  - name: \"LF Hold-One-Out 消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-lf-holdout\"\n    description: \"每次移除一个LF重新训练，量化各LF边际贡献\"\n    expected_results:\n      without_cmd_rep_conf2_f1: 0.8750\n      without_file_diff_conf2_f1: 0.8830\n      without_outcome_bp_conf2_f1: 0.8920\n      all_lfs_conf2_f1: 0.9055\n      cmd_rep_marginal_pp: 3.05\n      file_diff_marginal_pp: 2.25\n      outcome_bp_marginal_pp: 1.35\n      without_cmd_rep_fulldata_f1: 0.70\n      without_file_diff_fulldata_f1: 0.71\n      without_outcome_bp_fulldata_f1: 0.73\n      all_lfs_fulldata_f1: 0.74\n    result_rationale: >\n      command_repetition是最关键的LF（移除后conf≥2下降3.05pp，全量下降4pp），\n      因为它直接捕获最明显的stagnation信号。但在worst档下，即使最强的LF也只贡献\n      3-4pp，说明LFs之间高度冗余——它们捕获的是同一类\"容易\"的stagnation模式。\n      outcome_backpropagation贡献最小（1.35pp），因为它是lagging indicator，\n      在窗口级别的信号密度低。在全量数据上，移除任何单个LF的影响都不超过4pp，\n      说明LF集合的信息量有限。但正面发现是各LF的边际贡献排序本身揭示了信号层次：\n      command_repetition > file_diff_delta > outcome_backpropagation。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LF Hold-One-Out\"\n        columns: [\"Held-out LF\", \"conf≥2 F1\", \"Δ (pp)\", \"Full F1\", \"Δ (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"None (all LFs)\", \"0.9055\", \"—\", \"0.74\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"– command_repetition\", \"0.8750\", \"-3.05\", \"0.70\", \"-4.0\"]\n          - [\"– file_diff_delta\", \"0.8830\", \"-2.25\", \"0.71\", \"-3.0\"]\n          - [\"– outcome_backprop\", \"0.8920\", \"-1.35\", \"0.73\", \"-1.0\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Waterfall chart: 各LF的边际F1贡献，从baseline逐步叠加\"\n    analysis: >\n      LF贡献排序（cmd_rep > file_diff > outcome_bp）与直觉一致：leading indicator\n      贡献大于lagging indicator。这成为reframe中LF temporal dynamics分析的基础数据，\n      是贡献(1)的核心实证。\n\n  - name: \"SupCon 辅助损失消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-supcon\"\n    description: \"Supervised contrastive loss对F1和embedding分离度的影响\"\n    expected_results:\n      with_supcon_conf2_f1: 0.9055\n      without_supcon_conf2_f1: 0.8980\n      supcon_delta_conf2_pp: 0.75\n      with_supcon_fulldata_f1: 0.74\n      without_supcon_fulldata_f1: 0.73\n      supcon_delta_fulldata_pp: 1.0\n      embedding_separation_with: 0.42\n      embedding_separation_without: 0.38\n    result_rationale: >\n      SupCon在conf≥2上仅贡献0.75pp，在全量数据上1pp，在worst档下统计不显著。\n      原因是当标签本身噪声大时，contrastive loss试图拉近同标签样本、推远异标签\n      样本，但标签错误导致它在推错误的方向上也施加了力——净效果接近零。\n      Embedding分离度从0.38提升到0.42，改善有限。这确认在低标签质量下，\n      辅助损失的价值有限。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: SupCon 消融\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"conf≥2 F1\", \"Full F1\", \"Embed Separation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"With SupCon\", \"0.9055\", \"0.74\", \"0.42\"]\n          - [\"Without SupCon\", \"0.8980\", \"0.73\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"Δ\", \"+0.75pp\", \"+1.0pp\", \"+0.04\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE: with vs without SupCon的embedding空间对比，按label着色\"\n    analysis: >\n      SupCon增量不显著，确认标签噪声限制了contrastive learning的有效性。\n      在worst档下这是预期结果，不作为主要发现。\n\n  - name: \"Non-NLP Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"non-nlp-baseline\"\n    description: \"纯结构特征（行数改动、AST diff、test counts）分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      non_nlp_conf2_macro_f1: 0.83\n      non_nlp_fulldata_macro_f1: 0.70\n      non_nlp_stag_f1: 0.63\n      nlp_probe_fulldata_f1: 0.74\n      gap_nlp_vs_non_nlp_pp: 4.0\n      non_nlp_feature_count: 12\n      non_nlp_training_time_sec: 5\n    result_rationale: >\n      非NLP baseline在conf≥2上达0.83，全量数据0.70，与probe的差距仅4pp。\n      在worst档下，这个差距虽然存在但不够convincing——纯结构特征已经捕获了\n      stagnation的大部分信号（file改动数=0、命令失败率高、test pass率不变等）。\n      NL embedding的增量价值仅4pp，且这4pp可能来自embedding中隐含的结构信息\n      而非真正的语义理解。这削弱了venue fit argument（\"NL embedding是必要的\"），\n      但不完全否定——4pp在某些边界情况下可能是有意义的差异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: NLP vs Non-NLP Features\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Features\", \"conf≥2 F1\", \"Full F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe (NLP)\", \"1024-d embeddings\", \"0.9055\", \"0.74\"]\n          - [\"GBM (Non-NLP)\", \"12 structural features\", \"0.83\", \"0.70\"]\n          - [\"Gap\", \"—\", \"+7.55pp\", \"+4.0pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Feature importance plot: non-NLP baseline的top-12结构特征重要性排序\"\n    analysis: >\n      Non-NLP baseline竞争力较强，NL embedding增量有限。在reframe中需要弱化\n      \"NL embedding必要性\"的claim，转向\"embedding提供互补信号但非压倒性优势\"。\n\n  - name: \"Data Scaling 曲线\"\n    plan_id: \"data-scaling\"\n    description: \"10%/25%/50%/100%训练数据 → probe F1\"\n    expected_results:\n      scale_10pct_f1: 0.69\n      scale_25pct_f1: 0.72\n      scale_50pct_f1: 0.73\n      scale_100pct_f1: 0.74\n      curve_shape: \"log-saturating\"\n      saturation_point_pct: 30\n      marginal_gain_50_to_100_pp: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Scaling曲线在~30%数据量后即饱和，50%→100%仅增1pp。在worst档下这说明两件事：\n      (1)模型容量不是瓶颈——更多数据不能显著提升性能，因为新增数据主要是低conf噪声样本；\n      (2)当前架构+标签质量的性能天花板约在0.74-0.75。这是一个清醒的发现：\n      简单地收集更多弱监督数据不是解决方案，需要根本性地改善标签质量或模型能力。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Data Scaling\"\n        columns: [\"Train %\", \"Windows\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Δ vs previous\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"10%\", \"~4,380\", \"0.69\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"25%\", \"~10,960\", \"0.72\", \"+3pp\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"~21,920\", \"0.73\", \"+1pp\"]\n          - [\"100%\", \"43,847\", \"0.74\", \"+1pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Log-scale learning curve: x=训练数据量(log), y=macro-F1, 附95% CI band\"\n    analysis: >\n      早期饱和确认标签质量（而非数据量）是瓶颈。在reframe中这成为\"data programming\n      在sequential data上的scaling limitation\"的实证。\n\n  - name: \"Simulated Early Termination\"\n    plan_id: \"early-termination-sim\"\n    description: \"在held-out轨迹上模拟基于probe的early stopping，计算token节省vs成功率\"\n    expected_results:\n      tokens_saved_pct_probe: 18\n      tokens_saved_pct_repeat3: 16\n      tokens_saved_pct_oracle: 22\n      success_rate_drop_probe_pp: 4.5\n      success_rate_drop_repeat3_pp: 3.8\n      success_rate_drop_oracle_pp: 2.1\n      intervention_paradox_rate: 0.35\n      net_value_probe_vs_repeat3: \"marginal\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在worst档下，probe全量数据F1仅0.74，导致early termination的precision不足：\n      probe触发的停止中约26%是false positive（实际有进展但被判为停滞），导致\n      成功率下降4.5pp换取仅18%的token节省。更关键的是，Repeat-3作为简单规则也能\n      节省16%的token（仅少2pp），成功率下降还更小（3.8pp），说明probe的early\n      termination价值相对于简单规则几乎为零。Intervention paradox率0.35意味着\n      35%的被中止轨迹\"如果继续可能会成功\"，这进一步削弱了实用价值的论证。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Early Termination Simulation\"\n        columns: [\"Detector\", \"Tokens Saved (%)\", \"Success Rate Drop (pp)\", \"Efficiency Ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe (full)\", \"18%\", \"-4.5\", \"4.0\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"16%\", \"-3.8\", \"4.2\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle\", \"22%\", \"-2.1\", \"10.5\"]\n          - [\"LLM Judge\", \"25%\", \"-1.5\", \"16.7\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto curve: tokens saved (%) vs success rate drop (pp)，标注各方法\"\n      - \"Intervention paradox分析: 被中止轨迹中'如果继续会成功'的比例\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe的early termination价值marginally优于Repeat-3（多省2%token但多损1pp成功率），\n      净效果不具说服力。LLM judge反而是最优的早停检测器。在reframe中early termination\n      不再作为核心应用场景，仅在discussion中简短提及。\n\n  - name: \"Interpretability 可视化\"\n    plan_id: \"interpretability\"\n    description: \"GRU hidden states的t-SNE/UMAP + attention weight分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      cluster_separation_silhouette: 0.28\n      progress_stuck_overlap_pct: 35\n      attention_onset_concentration: 0.45\n      attention_pattern_interpretable: \"partial\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在worst档下，GRU hidden states的progress/stagnation聚类分离度较低\n      （silhouette=0.28，理想值>0.5），35%的样本在t-SNE空间上重叠。这反映了\n      两个问题：(1)标签噪声导致同一语义区域内混杂了两种标签；(2)GRU未能学到\n      清晰区分两类的表示。Attention weights在stagnation onset位置有一定集中\n      （concentration=0.45），但不够sharp来讲一个清晰的\"模型关注stagnation起始点\"\n      的故事。整体可解释性分析结果是\"partial\"——有一些可视化上看起来合理的pattern，\n      但不够compelling来支撑一个独立的发现。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 表示空间质量指标\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\", \"Ideal\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Silhouette score\", \"0.28\", \">0.5\"]\n          - [\"Class overlap %\", \"35%\", \"<15%\"]\n          - [\"Attention onset concentration\", \"0.45\", \">0.7\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE/UMAP: GRU final hidden states, colored by label, with conf-level as marker size\"\n      - \"Attention heatmap: 5个stagnation onset案例的attention weight分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      可视化结果不够compelling支撑独立发现。在reframe中降级为appendix材料，\n      不在正文中作为主要贡献。高overlap区域（conf=1样本主导）反而可以可视化\n      选择偏差——作为failure mode分析的补充。\n\n  - name: \"人工标注 Gold Set\"\n    plan_id: \"human-annotation\"\n    description: \"400窗口3标注者人工标注，Fleiss κ，在gold标签上重新评估所有方法\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_annotated: 400\n      fleiss_kappa: 0.52\n      human_majority_accuracy_vs_lf: 0.67\n      human_gold_probe_conf2_f1: 0.78\n      human_gold_probe_fulldata_f1: 0.68\n      human_gold_repeat3_f1: 0.72\n      human_gold_lf_oracle_f1: 0.65\n      human_gold_llm_judge_f1: 0.84\n      human_gold_meanpool_lr_f1: 0.66\n      disagreement_rate_3way: 0.28\n      semantic_stagnation_kappa: 0.38\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fleiss κ=0.52（moderate agreement）揭示stagnation本身是一个高主观性的概念——\n      标注者对\"语义停滞\"的判断分歧大（子类κ仅0.38）。LF majority vote与人工标签\n      的一致率仅67%，低于Phase 1 paper_framing.md声称的81.5%（那个数字仅在conf≥2\n      子集上测量）。在人工gold标签上重新评估：probe conf≥2的F1从0.9055跌至0.78，\n      probe全量从0.74跌至0.68——大幅下降是因为probe优化的目标（LF标签）与真实标签\n      存在系统性偏差。更关键的是，probe全量的0.68与Repeat-3的0.72相比反而落后4pp，\n      意味着在真实标签上probe不如简单启发式。LLM judge在gold标签上达0.84，是所有方法\n      中最好的——但成本高。这组结果是worst档的核心证据：弱监督标签质量不足，\n      probe在真实标签上无法beat baseline。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Human Gold Set 评估\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Gold-F1\", \"LF-label F1\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe (conf≥2)\", \"0.78\", \"0.9055\", \"-12.55pp\"]\n          - [\"GRU Probe (full)\", \"0.68\", \"0.74\", \"-6.0pp\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"0.72\", \"0.8432\", \"-12.32pp\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle\", \"0.65\", \"0.92\", \"-27.0pp\"]\n          - [\"Mean-pool + LR\", \"0.66\", \"0.72\", \"-6.0pp\"]\n          - [\"LLM Judge (few-shot)\", \"0.84\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table: 标注者一致性\"\n        columns: [\"Category\", \"Fleiss κ\", \"Agreement %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Overall\", \"0.52\", \"72%\"]\n          - [\"Clear progress\", \"0.68\", \"84%\"]\n          - [\"Clear stagnation\", \"0.61\", \"78%\"]\n          - [\"Semantic stagnation\", \"0.38\", \"58%\"]\n          - [\"Ambiguous\", \"0.29\", \"45%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix: LF majority vote vs human gold labels, 按conf分层\"\n      - \"方法对比bar chart: 所有方法在gold标签上的macro-F1，附CI\"\n      - \"Inter-annotator disagreement heatmap: 按stagnation子类型的κ值\"\n    analysis: >\n      人工标注是worst档的决定性证据。LF标签准确率67%（远低于声称的81.5%）直接\n      否定Claim 1。Probe在gold标签上落后Repeat-3（0.68 vs 0.72）否定Claim 2。\n      但κ=0.52也揭示了任务本身的固有困难——stagnation不是二元的，未来需要更细粒度\n      的标注schema（如进展程度的连续评分）。这在reframe中成为方法论贡献：\n      \"首次量化了agent stagnation标注的人类一致性上界\"。\n\n  - name: \"LF Temporal Dynamics\"\n    plan_id: \"lf-temporal-dynamics\"\n    description: \"分析各LF在stagnation onset相对时间上的激活模式\"\n    expected_results:\n      cmd_rep_avg_lead_steps: 1.8\n      cmd_rep_leading_indicator: true\n      file_diff_avg_lead_steps: 0.5\n      file_diff_concurrent: true\n      outcome_bp_avg_lag_steps: 2.3\n      outcome_bp_lagging_indicator: true\n      temporal_ordering_consistent_pct: 72\n      lf_transition_patterns_found: 4\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF temporal dynamics是worst档下最有价值的正面发现。command_repetition\n      平均在stagnation onset前1.8步开始亮灯（leading indicator）——agent开始\n      重复命令是停滞的早期信号。file_diff_delta几乎同时激活（concurrent，lead 0.5步），\n      因为命令重复很快导致文件变化停滞。outcome_backpropagation滞后2.3步\n      （lagging indicator），因为最终结果（test failure）需要等到窗口末端才能观察到。\n      这个leading→concurrent→lagging的时序排列在72%的stagnation事件中一致，\n      构成一个可复现的\"stagnation onset signature\"。此外发现4种distinct的LF\n      transition patterns（如\"cmd_rep先亮→file_diff跟随\"vs\"file_diff先亮→cmd_rep不亮\"），\n      揭示了不同类型的stagnation有不同的信号组合。这是reframe后论文的核心发现之一，\n      因为它不依赖probe性能，而是对stagnation现象本身的实证分析。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LF Temporal Ordering\"\n        columns: [\"LF\", \"Avg Lead/Lag (steps)\", \"Role\", \"Activation Rate at Onset\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"command_repetition\", \"-1.8 (lead)\", \"Leading\", \"0.78\"]\n          - [\"file_diff_delta\", \"-0.5 (concurrent)\", \"Concurrent\", \"0.71\"]\n          - [\"outcome_backprop\", \"+2.3 (lag)\", \"Lagging\", \"0.64\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Stagnation Onset Transition Patterns\"\n        columns: [\"Pattern\", \"Frequency\", \"Description\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Type A: cmd→file→outcome\", \"42%\", \"Classic repetition-driven stagnation\"]\n          - [\"Type B: file→cmd→outcome\", \"18%\", \"Exploration failure (new files, same errors)\"]\n          - [\"Type C: cmd only\", \"15%\", \"Pure command loop, files never change\"]\n          - [\"Type D: outcome→file→cmd\", \"12%\", \"Cascading failure from bad early decision\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Timeline visualization: 5个case study的LF激活时序，显示leading/lagging关系\"\n      - \"Heatmap: LF co-activation patterns across stagnation onset ±5 steps\"\n      - \"Stagnation taxonomy pie chart: 4种transition pattern的分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      LF temporal dynamics是worst档reframe的核心贡献。4种stagnation onset pattern\n      构成首个基于实证的agent stagnation taxonomy。Leading/lagging排序提供了\n      实际的工程价值——在部署场景下可以仅监控command_repetition作为早期预警，\n      无需等待所有LF激活。这个发现不依赖probe性能，因此在worst档下仍然成立，\n      成为论文从\"method paper\"转向\"empirical study\"的关键支撑。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f5a46152-74b1-408a-bae6-c5406fa64319","total_cost_usd":0.42169150000000005,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10680,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":13731,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10680,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":13731,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10680,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10680},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":5646,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.005736,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":13731,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":10680,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.41595550000000003,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"bd7b05bd-b27c-47fa-804d-aa8149b651b9"}
